                                <h3>Event Detail</h3>
                                <p>On July 1, 2024, Skillbook Skill Development Centre hosted a CAD Simulation Workshop at its Rohini Sector-6 facility, near Visram Chowk, specifically for ITI Shahadra DMM students. This workshop provided a comprehensive look into CAD simulation, offering live learning experiences with an emphasis on practical application.
                                    Students were introduced to essential software, including 3ds Max, and received in-depth training on industry-level applications. With a focus on building foundational skills, the workshop offered an opportunity to gain insights from Skillbook’s experienced tutors and engage in hands-on practice.
                                    The workshop was entirely free, reaffirming Skillbook’s commitment to accessible education. Students actively participated throughout the day, and as the session wrapped up, their smiles and gratitude reflected a rewarding experience that added valuable skills for their future careers.
                                    </p>
                                <a class="theam_btn btn2 text_white bg_color" href="/#contactIncq">Join Us</a>
